Imports: `useClearQuestionErrors, useQuestionErrors, useQuestionResponse` from `@/components/QuestionnaireV2/renderer/store` (lines 4–8); `structuredDefinitionFor` from `@/components/QuestionnaireV2/structured/registry` (line 9 — the NEW registry, not `renderer/structured/`); `ResponseValue` from `@/types/questionnaire/form`; `Question` from `@/types/questionnaire/question`; `useFormRenderer` from `./FormContext`.

